Rule 2 (input and target must be floating tensors with the same dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= 6 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 8 ∧ dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_2)
