Rule 5 (weight tensor must be non-negative and have the same floating dtype as input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= 6 ≤ dtype_(v_3) ∧ dtype_(v_3) ≤ 8 ∧ dtype_(v_3) = dtype_(v_1) ∧ 0 ≤ min(v_3)
