Rule 6 (weight must be scalar or exactly match input shape)
{v_1 : tensor, v_3 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_3) = 0) ∨ (ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_3) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_3, i))
